      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding more info\n-Is not solved by clean installing graphic driver\n-Different account VRC account on the same PC won't have this problem, so the problem seems to be tied to the account, not the device\n-Can be solved by clearing local profile data ( with regedit, not with in-game menu ) though\nSince clearing local profile data with in-game menu doesn't fix the problem but clearing via registry does,\nthe cause of the problem might be related to something in local profile data which wouldn't be cleared with \"Clear all local profile data\" in-game menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
