      "value": "I'm on my FIFTH alt account because this is the only way I've found to fix it (without editing my cache) is to log into a clean alt, restart SteamVR, boot VRC, then log into the main account. I have FOUR ACCOUNTS that have gotten this bug and am now out of emails... please fix this.",
